  "final_message": "The bug was in `collect()` in [billing/payments.py](/tmp/bsvc-bgh2784l/billing-service/billing/payments.py): it returned when no payment method existed without recording a failure. That prevented the event, retry schedule, and subscription state change.\n\nThe fix sends that case through dunning. A lifecycle test confirms retries and the eventual `unpaid` state. All 25 tests pass. I also wrote [answer.json](/tmp/bsvc-bgh2784l/billing-service/answer.json).",
